    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109125" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσκάπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dig under, dig about,</i>
			
